    "body": "@Mephistophiles, that's because the default symbol for the `cmake` module was changed. IIRC, it was an emoji previously and fish sometimes have a problem with the display of emojis (you need to use `set -g fish_emoji_width 2` in order to fix that).\r\n\r\nIf you cannot reproduce this issue anymore, can it be closed?",
